{"name":"Afternoon Coffee","hex":"#6e544b","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"afternoon","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The part of the day from noon or lunchtime until sunset, evening, or suppertime or 6pm.","The later part of anything, often with implications of decline."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["In the afternoon."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/afternoon"},{"term":"coffee","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A beverage made by infusing the beans of the coffee plant in hot water. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A serving of this beverage."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a pale brown colour, like that of milk coffee.","Of a table: a small, low table suitable for people in lounge seating to put coffee cups on."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/coffee"}],"entries":[{"title":"Afternoon","blocks":[{"text":"Afternoon is the period from noon to sunset or evening. It is the time when the sun is descending from its peak in the sky to somewhat before its terminus at the horizon in the west. In human life, it occupies roughly the latter half of the standard work and school day. In literal terms, it refers to a time specifically after noon."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Wien_T%C3%BCrkenschanzpark_%282376611600%29.jpg/330px-Wien_T%C3%BCrkenschanzpark_%282376611600%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Afternoon"},{"title":"Coffee","blocks":[{"text":"Coffee is a beverage brewed from roasted, ground coffee beans. Dark-colored and bitter, coffee has a stimulating effect on humans due to its caffeine content; however decaffeinated coffee is also commercially available. There are also various coffee substitutes."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Latte_and_dark_coffee.jpg/330px-Latte_and_dark_coffee.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee"},{"title":"Coffee (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Coffee is a brownish color that is a representation of a roasted coffee bean. Different types of coffee beans have different colors when roasted—the color coffee represents an average."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Roasted_coffee_beans.jpg/330px-Roasted_coffee_beans.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee_(color)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Rooftop_Bar%2C_Metropolitan_Museum_Of_Art_%285894065780%29.jpg/500px-Rooftop_Bar%2C_Metropolitan_Museum_Of_Art_%285894065780%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Rooftop_Bar%2C_Metropolitan_Museum_Of_Art_%285894065780%29.jpg/1280px-Rooftop_Bar%2C_Metropolitan_Museum_Of_Art_%285894065780%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Rooftop_Bar%2C_Metropolitan_Museum_Of_Art_%285894065780%29.jpg/500px-Rooftop_Bar%2C_Metropolitan_Museum_Of_Art_%285894065780%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Visitors to the Metropolitan Museum of Art in New York City during the late afternoon","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARooftop_Bar%2C_Metropolitan_Museum_Of_Art_(5894065780).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Car_accident_poland_2008.jpg/500px-Car_accident_poland_2008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Car_accident_poland_2008.jpg/500px-Car_accident_poland_2008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","a